# JWT Authentication API

A backend authentication project built with **FastAPI, SQLModel, and SQLite**, implementing JWT-based authentication with access tokens and refresh token rotation.

## Features

- User signup and login
- Password hashing using Argon2
- JWT access tokens with a 15-minute expiry
- Securely stored refresh token hashes
- Refresh token rotation with 7-day expiry
- Protected routes using FastAPI dependencies
- Logout by revoking the current refresh token
- SQLite database integration using SQLModel

## Tech Stack

- Python
- FastAPI
- SQLModel
- SQLite
- PyJWT
- pwdlib with Argon2
- python-dotenv

